        "jstests/sharding/safe_secondary_reads_drop_recreate.js": "Adds the `requires_scripting` tag (with a comment) because the test runs mapReduce with JS map/reduce functions.",
        "src/mongo/db/BUILD.bazel": "Switches the `dependency` load from `@poetry` to `//bazel/uv:defs.bzl`. Renames the `metrics_policy_manager_impl` target to `metrics_policy_manager_mongod` (updating references in the server binary and crud_bm benchmark) and adds a new `metrics_policy_manager_mongos` target; the atlas disagg dependency is likewise split into `_disagg_mongod`/`_disagg_mongos`. Changes the scripting select from `//bazel/config:server_js_enabled` to `//bazel/config:server_js_engine_allowed`.",
